      "source": "rem 47-smooth Triangular Numbers\nrem https://projecteuler.net/problem=581\n\nuse numbers\nuse sequences\nuse io\nuse cli\n\narg B integer = 10000000000000\n\nrem T(2x) = x (2x + 1) and T(2x - 1) =\nrem x (2x - 1) with coprime factors, so\nrem T(n) is smooth when both factors\nrem are. List the 47-smooth x up to B\nrem and match 2x + 1 and 2x - 1 with\nrem those up to 2B + 1 after a sort.\nLm = 2 * B + 1\nSm = array 1\nfor P in primes till 48 array\n  Cu = Sm\n  for Cu len greater 0\n    Cu = Cu * P\n    Ix = Cu at most Lm indices\n    Cu = Cu Ix\n    Sm = concat Sm Cu\n  end\nend\nSorted = Sm sort\nNext = Sorted shift -1\nGood = Next - Sorted equal 1\nAnswer = Sorted Good sum\nAnswer print\n"
    },
